/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Vendored tokenizer files (tokenizer.json / tiktoken.model) ARE committed on
# purpose so the repo builds fully offline. They are pinned + checksum-verified
# via scripts/fetch-tokenizers.sh and tokenizers/checksums.sha256.
# Note: they live permanently in git history; large opt-in models can instead be
# fetched at build time if you prefer to keep the repo lean.
